{
  "name": "Invoice Processing & Review - Main",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup required\n1. Verify Header Auth, Gmail, OpenAI, Google Sheets and Telegram credentials after import.\n2. Create the Gmail label `invoice-intake` and a Gmail filter that applies it only to invoice messages.\n3. Re-select the Google Sheet and `Invoices` tab if n8n asks to refresh column mappings.\n4. Create n8n variable `INVOICE_ALERT_CHAT_ID`.\n5. Import and select the companion error workflow in workflow settings.\n6. Test the webhook branch before activating Gmail processing.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
